{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "猎头电话与伦敦灵的来头  (Headhunter Calls and London Ling's Reputation)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Swearing they would rather quit than work under Xie Ling, Kaiwen and Xingzi let their desk phones ring nonstop as rival studios and headhunters try to poach Chun Yuqiao's team. Listen to their Mandarin banter first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不干了，与其受他的气，为了尊严我绝对不干了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你俩先别吵了，要不要先接一下电话？是不是有什么急事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没什么急事，全都是猎头打来的电话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们两个要被别人挖走了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你知道这几天有多少公司、多少电视台跟我们谈入职吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有人现在出到我工资的三倍，希望我去打个前站迎接老大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我把你电话也发给猎头了，把你吹成总编室第二把交椅、淳于乔入室弟子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们刚才叫他伦敦灵，那是什么意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "人家海外引进节目搞得可好了，欧洲节目玩得风生水起，人送外号伦敦灵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那个我知道，超新星就是一个英国节目改版的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "做海外引进除了王尔就是他厉害，现在欧版节目风靡全球，谢灵越来越吃香了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他跟王尔老师的路数不大一样，各有千秋，王尔可从来不认可原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不干了，与其受他的气，为了尊严我绝对不干了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I quit—rather than put up with him, for the sake of my dignity I am definitely quitting!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你俩先别吵了，要不要先接一下电话？是不是有什么急事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop arguing for a second and answer your phones—could it be something urgent?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没什么急事，全都是猎头打来的电话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing urgent; every single call is from a headhunter.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们两个要被别人挖走了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are other companies trying to poach the two of you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你知道这几天有多少公司、多少电视台跟我们谈入职吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have any idea how many companies and television networks are courting us these days?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有人现在出到我工资的三倍，希望我去打个前站迎接老大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Someone just offered triple my salary, hoping I will go ahead as an advance scout for the boss.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我把你电话也发给猎头了，把你吹成总编室第二把交椅、淳于乔入室弟子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I gave headhunters your number too and billed you as second-in-command and Chun Yuqiao's prized disciple!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们刚才叫他伦敦灵，那是什么意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You called him London Ling earlier—what does that nickname mean?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "人家海外引进节目搞得可好了，欧洲节目玩得风生水起，人送外号伦敦灵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He excels at importing overseas formats and runs European remakes with flair, earning the nickname London Ling.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那个我知道，超新星就是一个英国节目改版的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know about that; Supernova was adapted from a British format.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "做海外引进除了王尔就是他厉害，现在欧版节目风靡全球，谢灵越来越吃香了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Aside from Wang Er, nobody beats him at overseas imports; with European formats booming globally, Xie Ling is in high demand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他跟王尔老师的路数不大一样，各有千秋，王尔可从来不认可原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His style differs somewhat from Wang Er's, each with his own strengths, though Wang Er has never believed in original shows.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不干了，与其受他的气，为了尊严我绝对不干了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你俩先别吵了，要不要先接一下电话？是不是有什么急事啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
